g. Or we could reconsider, but likely we keep C.\n\nWe need to produce a public message: state current recommendation (Candidate C), refer to discussion (Markus's shift, Sofia's points), use explicit facts: C makes correct decisions quickly, 100% reliable, creates positive crew atmosphere; B lacks decision quality and responsibility evidence; also note C's communication issues but positive atmosphere mitigates. Conclude we maintain C.\n\nThen METADATA_JSON with agent \"agent_1\" and vote \"Candidate C\".\n\nProceed."}
